  npm run typecheck,project,pi-agent,"2026-09-06T05:10:31.731Z",local_mutation,security/refuse-quote-breaking-cmd-argument
  npm run coverage,project,pi-agent,"2026-09-06T05:10:32.296Z",local_mutation,security/refuse-quote-breaking-cmd-argument
  npm run docstring,project,pi-agent,"2026-09-06T05:10:32.898Z",local_mutation,security/refuse-quote-breaking-cmd-argument
close_reason: "Refused literal double quotes before cmd.exe tail construction; documented the cmd.exe-before-CommandLineToArgvW parser boundary; added direct exploit refusal and quote-state property regressions; source-only revert produced exactly 2 failing tests; build, test, typecheck, coverage, and docstring gates passed."
body: ""
